        ],
        [
          49,
          58
        ],
        [
          61,
          70
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the IP range you want to modify, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          54,
          58
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Edit IP Range drawer appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit IP Range drawer, modify the fields as necessary. To learn more about each field, see Adding IP Ranges.",
